{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01028","headline":"相和歌辞 公无渡河 · 李白","name":"相和歌辞 公无渡河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄河西来决崐崘，咆吼万里触龙门。\n波滔天，尧咨嗟。\n大禹理百川，儿啼不窥家。\n杀湍湮洪水，九州始蚕麻。\n其害乃去，茫然风沙。\n被发之叟狂而痴，清晨径流欲奚爲。\n旁人不惜妻止之，公无渡河苦渡之。\n虎可搏，河难凭。\n公果溺死流海湄，有长鲸白齿若雪山。\n公乎公乎，挂骨於其间，箜篌所悲竟不还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}